[{"title":"韩圣秋舍人见过响山草堂即事 其一","author":"梅磊","text":"旷览世故多，毕志力南亩。\n矧耽山水幽，卜筑遂云久。\n朝耕暮垂纶，草木甘同朽。\n讵谓名姓存，空谷来吾友。\n怀旧古道稀，兹意君何厚。\n感德情倍殷，拮据启户牖。\n山鸡去屋啼，竹鼯隔篱走。\n入室简盘餐，藨客一何有。\n僮仆采樵归，邻家贳新酒。\n昔贤气谊真，定交在杵臼。\n炊饮忘主宾，至今美庞叟。\n君怀原古人，此义良有取。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7791,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"韩圣秋舍人见过响山草堂即事 其二","author":"梅磊","text":"是时八月交，炎蒸酷于暑。\n徙席向深林，凉风浩如许。\n新瓜间梨枣，次第给园圃。\n开襟重斟酌，纵谈无今古。\n酿蜜蜂从王，戏水凫傍母。\n感念物类生，一一得其所。\n翻愧人世间，丧乱多辛苦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7792,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日谈长益方尔止见访同家弟昆白赋答","author":"梅磊","text":"粳稻朝初获，荷花晚更香。\n萤飞将草乱，牛饭就松凉。\n斯世多充隐，吾徒或醒狂。\n秋林携小谢，吟咏可相当。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7793,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄池晤陈伯玑即别","author":"梅磊","text":"薄暮闻君至，沿途问客船。\n残虹明驿树，归鸟破江烟。\n立语殊无序，孤征极可怜。\n柳桥分手处，新月正娟娟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7794,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄刘伯宗兼问次尾诸孤 其一","author":"梅磊","text":"九子山头草木悲，五年江上雁鸿迟。\n吹箫食拟从人乞，吞炭声还畏友知。\n吾道荆榛空岁序，中原战斗几须眉。\n只今才彦看将尽，爱尔冰霜独自持。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7795,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄刘伯宗兼问次尾诸孤 其二","author":"梅磊","text":"黄云晻暧凤凰台，六代烟花一草莱。\n覆瓮少虚皇甫誉，衔杯老忆谪仙才。\n春风蜡屐游应数，夜月然藜阁好开。\n回首楼山堂上客，遗书孤子重堪哀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7796,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉答李叔则明府招同张稚恭汤君谟晚集","author":"梅磊","text":"汪边荒草欲黄昏，好客烦开永夜樽。\n杨柳月明栖海燕，桃花水涨上河豚。\n乱离词赋才将尽，故旧穷愁伴几存。\n此夕高堂丝管发，狂歌难禁醉中喧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7797,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日龚芝麓总宪招集孝侯台","author":"梅磊","text":"寻秋日爱城南路，吊古周侯况有台。\n廿载乱离为客过，半生怀抱见山开。\n松寒翠色侵衣履，菊老风香到酒杯。\n向晚凭高更搔首，一声霜雁月中来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7798,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日杂咏","author":"梅磊","text":"云度千峰日渐低，柴门深闭响山西。\n东风不识人愁思，水长花开鸟乱啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7799,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送人","author":"梁份","text":"相逢言未了，意气倍相亲。\n君欲成何事，余惭负此身。\n赁舂仍避汉，蹈海不知秦。\n耻作桃源客，春风坐误人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7800,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送杨而上还剑上","author":"梁份","text":"最愁浮汉沔，晚泊向寒汀。\n山夹天垂幕，舟轻水建瓴。\n家从云外望，猿到夜分听。\n却爱乡园树，苍茫到眼青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7801,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送梅定九北上","author":"梁份","text":"曾期南国共苔岑，班马萧萧泪满襟。\n北去沙尘千里暗，西来风雨九秋深。\n匡时争重天人学，作客难忘水石心。\n寄语白云休怅望，燕台非羡筑黄金。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7802,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泛洞庭湖","author":"陆次云","text":"大浸数五湖，莫大于洞庭。\n时当春夏交，雪融水气蒸。\n仰视但有天，与波同一青。\n茫茫六合中，不见大块形。\n三老弄洪涛，澎湃意所轻。\n至此乃敬慎，风正始扬舲。\n同舟色俱静，半帆容与行。\n此中有楠木，千载成英灵。\n出没每不时，异响令人惊。\n舟妇散纸钱，徐徐乃就平。\n死生呼吸间，宴坐犹兢兢。\n吁嗟缥缈中，难测鬼神情。\n或问传书事，心知不敢应。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7803,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登岱","author":"陆次云","text":"得过三观下，因上岱宗巅。\n海吸长河远，天包大地圆。\n五更先见日，九点半升烟。\n孰谓方隅广，回环睥睨前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7804,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白沟河","author":"陆次云","text":"道出白沟河，沈吟唤奈何。\n古今陵谷变，高下战场多。\n厉鬼依残骨，耕人拾断戈。\n烽烟嗟又甚，搔首一悲歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7805,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题荆山石壁","author":"陆次云","text":"寄语山灵听啸歌，连城再刖叹如何？\n人间碧眼应难遇，莫产琼瑶误卞和。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7806,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠芷江隐者","author":"陆次云","text":"十二峰回十八滩，渔舟欲上问津难。\n山亭春尽无人过，开遍桃花只自看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7807,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题方石居赠忍公用吴愧庵先生韵","author":"钮琇","text":"方庭修竹绿如围，琴榻书床识静机。\n紫朮夜舂供客饭，白云秋制入山衣。\n落花径曲呼童埽，斜日林空放鹤归。\n最喜远公宽酒戒，虎溪乘月叩禅扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7808,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事","author":"钮琇","text":"赭服南冠两鬓华，却携妻子系天涯。\n春风客泪河桥柳，夜月乡心驿路笳。\n恸哭范滂犹有母，飘零张俭已无家。\n只今知己多豪侠，空忆当时广柳车。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7809,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日病寓江城丰翠园","author":"钮琇","text":"绿阴孤阁晚来登，极目风烟望几层。\n万堞暮云寒戍鼓，一江秋雨暗渔镫。\n思归菊已荒彭泽，病渴人还卧茂陵。\n欲向君平问出处，浮沈身世总难凭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7810,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古诗·行行重行行","author":"戴廷栻","text":"行行重行行，裹粮戴吾笠。\n修途日以荒，所在生荆棘。\n犹豫立道傍，徘徊以叹息。\n所苦非别离，浩荡无所适。\n深谷暮烟平，长河明月飞。\n孤云藐旷覼，转蓬何时归。\n忠信不可托，廉介多见欺。\n惆怅返故乡，且复掩柴扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7811,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古诗·青青陵上柏","author":"戴廷栻","text":"青青陵上柏，不生培塿间。\n琐琐矜名士，谁能共往还。\n驱车出国门，游戏上西山。\n草木多淑气，云霞怡我颜。\n擘脯酌载酒，哀筝独自弹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7812,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古诗·今日良宴会","author":"戴廷栻","text":"今日良宴会，宾客相追逐。\n四座列氍毹，帘下奏丝竹。\n金樽倾美酒，玉盘盛粱肉。\n众人皆醉饱，贱夫愈局促。\n群居无高论，不如处幽独。\n归来炊寒灶，脱粟煮薄粥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7813,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古诗·涉江采芙蓉","author":"戴廷栻","text":"涉江采芙蓉，花叶皆茂好。\n所赠不合意，一夕颜色槁。\n人生感知己，此意向谁道。\n荡舟越江归，寂寞向芳草。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7814,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古诗·庭前有奇树","author":"戴廷栻","text":"庭前有奇树，日夕抚碧梧。\n墙墉自峻绝，盘桓以为娱。\n盈盈环堵绿，亭亭百尺孤。\n息荫无佳人，所辱甚泥涂。\n凤凰虽不来，安能共狂夫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7815,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古诗·西北有高楼","author":"戴廷栻","text":"西北有高楼，徙倚聊淹留。\n平原千余里，远道何悠悠。\n日夕回风起，河水散乱流。\n相思杳难托，登高翻更愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7816,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古诗·青青河畔草","author":"戴廷栻","text":"青青河畔草，离离路旁柳。\n悠悠送行人，泛泛举杯酒。\n终鲜素心人，何许同携手。\n归来掩柴荆，无语自垂首。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7817,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古诗·人生不满百","author":"戴廷栻","text":"人生不满百，达人固知之。\n情重性命轻，况当离乱时。\n所见不合意，退避了无辞。\n怀抱不可遣，付之于酒卮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7818,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即事感怀赠友","author":"戴廷栻","text":"云谊贵公子，风流及老狂。\n由来多意气，不仅妙文章。\n青取江南雨，寒消塞北霜。\n搴云见朗月，此意在君旁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7819,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日同许青屿侍郎过尧峰","author":"吴历","text":"尧峰钟磬里，一径入云林。\n黄叶诗人兴，空山老衲心。\n茶桑秋坞静，鸳鹭水天阴。\n谢屐都忘险，烟霞此地深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7820,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吊孙太初处士墓","author":"吴历","text":"行到归云高隐地，孤猿野鹤尚哀鸣。\n晴溪绿满侵难尽，秋叶红稀踏未平。\n垄上只今惟虎迹，堂前何处有瓢声。\n持竿白首烟波里，寂寞无人问姓名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7821,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其一","author":"吴历","text":"陌头柳色暗毵毵，欲写离情忍泪缄。\n春雁可怜齐向北，那堪游子在江南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7822,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"吴历","text":"雨歇遥天水气腥，树连僧屋雁连汀。\n松风谡谡行人少，云白山青冷画屏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7823,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其三","author":"吴历","text":"春风阡陌草初平，远岫烟浮细雨晴。\n白屋门前乌桕树，夕阳高下鹧鸪声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7824,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其四","author":"吴历","text":"梦回西望碧山微，一水斜阳鸟不飞。\n欲采青黄莲子叶，寄君先制卧云衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7825,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其五","author":"吴历","text":"绿摆杨枝生白烟，茅堂深掩半溪边。\n二年踏雪燕台畔，辜负梅花月影眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7826,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其六","author":"吴历","text":"杨白花飞楚水东，竹林西转竹桥通。\n扁舟载酒冲烟去，一路潇湘泼墨中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7827,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其七","author":"吴历","text":"谷口闲闲云气收，松杉高下自成丘。\n草堂且喜终南外，束帛无劳任白头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7828,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其八","author":"吴历","text":"萧疏竹木倚江滨，石脚披莎拂浪新。\n一带远山衔落日，草亭秋影澹无人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7829,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"王概","text":"湖干路僻无车马，葭菼苍苍凉到天。\n长日接䍦慵不著，草堂闲对鹭鸶眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7830,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄赠沈留侯偕小阮北上","author":"顾有孝","text":"春风杨柳拂行舟，有美联翩共远游。\n入洛陆机新作赋，依刘王粲故多愁。\n旧京珠履三千客，荒冢冬青一十秋。\n湖上好山无恙在，独持卮酒对群鸥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7831,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送罗比部暂归西川","author":"钟映渊","text":"白帝孤城落照悬，乡愁迢递武功天。\n将归故国无鸿雁，行过空山有杜鹃。\n剑阁风云开五丈，筇关烽火隔三川。\n明年巫峡生春水，好上东吴万里船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7832,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和阮亭绿雪诗","author":"陆嘉淑","text":"岕山纱帽顶，歙溪松萝岩。\n蒸炒与烘焙，其妙苦不兼。\n虎丘日铸价，欲敌气味儳。\n银瓶署细字，绿雪谁所缄。\n烹泉手亲泼，一啜意已忺。\n燕中泽泻卤，吐漱常恨咸。\n昨来一夜雨，白液浮岩嵌。\n欣然接新句，上有红印钳。\n渔洋竟同好，清韵流霜帘。\n诗翁字山白，初卸南来帆。\n不惜手露芽，分贻压贫奁。\n犀液泛翠瓯，蟾香透重襜。\n顿轸昔所珍，时俗定可砭。\n何须怀莼羹，千里炊豉盐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7833,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同旦中坐梅花书屋","author":"陆嘉淑","text":"三间书屋昼常扃，好客偏能浃夕停。\n但数旧人如落叶，即看我辈亦晨星。\n药炉烟覆花阴合，竹牖云衔海气青。\n虬干亭亭两梅老，待留冰雪吐芳馨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7834,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送武曾之宣府","author":"查容","text":"由拳城头月华白，张灯置酒宴征客。\n由拳城外柳条青，平明相送出津亭。\n羡君意气真无比，此去幽州几千里。\n揽辔遥看冀北云，挂帆径渡淮南水。\n太行山高日欲斜，边风飒飒飞尘沙。\n候骑千屯吹觱篥，明驼一队奏琵琶。\n上谷使者与君厚，辕门揖客论故旧。\n伐鼓鸣笳部曲前，锦筵红烛军麾后。\n觥筹交错坐忘疲，玉缸泻酒醉难辞。\n壮士横刀看草檄，美人挟瑟请题诗。\n丈夫三十犹未遇，走马穷边那复顾。\n野狐岭下白草枯，卧龙冈上黄云暮。\n客中行乐不知年，但看月出几回圆。\n沙场忽听思归曲，应使乡关望眼穿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7835,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"碧云寺后山","author":"朱尔迈","text":"曲径自然好，不知山已深。\n苍苍石潭上，了无人世心。\n境幽思转寂，秋气加萧森。\n回身蹑高岫，忽焉逾百寻。\n横阜展右臂，谷湖荡前襟。\n下视所历径，云壑弥沈沈。\n寄声谢热客，此地饶清阴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7836,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜上云岫庵","author":"朱尔迈","text":"青山惬所怀，一步一延伫。\n不觉夜色来，苍苍没平楚。\n失道径转纡，陟历忘峻阻。\n忽然身已高，舄下闻人语。\n欲辨已微茫，东西无处所。\n疏竹逗镫光，始知隔岩户。\n奋策争先登，却怪来风雨。\n住足问徐徐，潮声走远浦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7837,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戎州杂诗","author":"朱尔迈","text":"匹马登城暮，苍凉极望间。\n青衣天半水，乌撒瘴余山。\n风激边笳裂，霜危峡草斑。\n独携雄剑在，长啸拂金环。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7838,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"俯江亭秋眺 其一","author":"朱尔迈","text":"金鸡岭接汶江滨，曾说当时物色新。\n花下醉归珠勒马，月中歌送玉楼人。\n荔枝香熟蛮方雨，橦布温生汉殿春。\n回首那堪兵甲后，白荆黄葛乱青磷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7839,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"俯江亭秋眺 其二","author":"朱尔迈","text":"北风一夜度沧洲，龙马江光抱日流。\n北引荒荒蛮树直，东连淰淰楚云浮。\n几年壁垒分天堑，万国舟车阻上游。\n草野无人收战骨，黄沙不散铁衣秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7840,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"插花山居诗同弟寒将作 其一","author":"马思赞","text":"未必桃源便弗如，此乡洵美是吾居。\n衣冠俗俭风犹古，耕凿人多力有余。\n绕屋定栽千个竹，几家同种一池鱼。\n近来长算村翁富，卖与山田得买书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7841,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"插花山居诗同弟寒将作 其二","author":"马思赞","text":"浓云暖雨互悠悠，寒食前头社后头。\n两月笋膏充肉味，一年茶事算春收。\n鸟当久坐声逾美，花到无名种最幽。\n料理茶炉兼酒榼，独寻萱草对忘忧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7842,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"插花山居诗同弟寒将作 其三","author":"马思赞","text":"最爱西风换夹衣，一番秋色到柴扉。\n不除衰草留虫语，但扫空阶候叶飞。\n带角未妨菱稍贵，然萁或恐豆旋稀。\n直愁恼乱比邻意，珍重儿童唤鸭归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7843,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大尖山下最佳处","author":"马思赞","text":"林泉何处养疏慵，准拟移家占一峰。\n木未饱霜浓过夏，水初收潦净于冬。\n山阴白昼疑天雨，潮响黄昏杂寺钟。\n一事病夫犹当意，茯苓根护万年松。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7844,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"横山蛟潭同朱十彝尊赋","author":"沈进","text":"积铁立千仞，行人堕苍黑。\n危风动山根，侧见雷雨人。\n阴崖闭长廊，鬼火白日出。\n视听惊心魂，峰峦俯突兀。\n微涓滴松枝，清响久寂历。\n爱兹丛薄深，栖迟慰晨夕。\n庶不孤愿言，超然慕畴昔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7845,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡浙江别陆处士圻","author":"沈进","text":"凄恻临歧路，苍黄对远天。\n春风官舍柳，暮雨石林烟。\n樯燕来还去，山云断复连。\n今宵何处泊，愁坐扣离舷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7846,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹤洲看梅同李人表","author":"沈进","text":"地近裴休宅，人称太守园。\n风烟湖上郡，橘柚水边村。\n细路垂藤碍，欹沙带雨浑。\n梅花飞不尽，香雪满庭垣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7847,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆湘湖","author":"沈岸登","text":"菱叶初肥稻叶黄，茅椽八九在中央。\n日斜驱犊笆篱外，水落叉鱼略彴旁。\n云阵半浮山面白，竹风时作雨声凉。\n秋来更有牵情处，紫蟹黄鸡恣意尝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7848,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋暝","author":"沈岸登","text":"木叶落未歇，秋村欲暝时。\n荻花闱细艇，鸟影定寒枝。\n野色茫无际，离居有所思。\n百端于此集，不是为秋悲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7849,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"昭平道中","author":"沈用济","text":"滩势奔腾下，舟行次第高。\n瀑流争一石，人力尽千篙。\n壁峭奔雷雨，林深聚羽毛。\n江乡归未得，梦寐亦风涛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7850,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望西岳","author":"沈用济","text":"五千仞削势崔巍，西镇坤维玉作台。\n海日夜从金掌出，莲花春向石盆开。\n宫临白帝三峰立，城绕黄河九折来。\n欲跨茅龙问酒母，芝田堪种乏仙才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7851,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登大观楼","author":"孙默","text":"一望天无际，凭高俯大荒。\n马驰烽火径，人在水云乡。\n短棹迷春草，疏钟送夕阳。\n百年车笠意，对此倍难忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7852,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将归黄山留别诸同学","author":"孙默","text":"伯皋应下谢朝春，回首淮南遍夕烽。\n客到空城余蔓草，身随孤剑冷芙蓉。\n秋深始买江边棹，古寺还听天外钟。\n黄海只愁迷旧路，仙人丹灶白云封。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7853,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]